             fragment inclusion purposes.  Some specific _n_a_m_e_s have extra
             meaning, see bsd.port.mk(5) and package(5) for details:

             CCDDRROOMM        Set to the port's Makefile _P_E_R_M_I_T___P_A_C_K_A_G_E___C_D_R_O_M.
