     @@eexxttrraauunneexxeecc _c_o_m_m_a_n_d
             Extra _c_o_m_m_a_n_d to execute when removing extra files.

     @@ffiillee _f_i_l_e_n_a_m_e
             Default annotation, to use if _f_i_l_e_n_a_m_e begins with @.  _f_i_l_e_n_a_m_e
             is always a relative path, relative to the current @@ccwwdd.

     @@ffoonnttddiirr _d_i_r_e_c_t_o_r_y_n_a_m_e
             Specialized version of @@ddiirr, to handle font directories: create
             _f_o_n_t_._a_l_i_a_s from _f_o_n_t_._a_l_i_a_s_-_* fragments, execute mkfontdir(1),
